WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:02,270
Sister, dinner is ready

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:13,720
It’s been a year and a half since I’ve been in the ink room.

3
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,610
How can you still eat fresh food?

4
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:18,110
We grew it ourselves

5
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,110
Please eat

6
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:21,110
We eat food grown by my eldest sister every day

7
00:00:21,110 --> 00:00:22,110
So fresh

8
00:00:22,110 --> 00:00:24,650
Everyone has planted it on the rooftop.

9
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:25,650
Prolonged sweating

10
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:26,650
Can't grow it at all

11
00:00:26,650 --> 00:00:28,650
No, I'm going up

12
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:31,350
after eating

13
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:36,840
Send a hundred pounds of rice and Shixiang instant noodles to the third floor.

14
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,870
Large white rice

15
00:00:37,870 --> 00:00:39,370
And meat

16
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:40,370
We are all so meaty

17
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:41,370
Cauliflower, cauliflower and eggs

18
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:43,370
Each of them was given a braised egg

19
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:45,370
What are mom’s braised eggs?
